
load @term/seed/code/lang
  find code-hook

mint hook, like code-hook
  case name
    site name
  case line
    site line
  case base, mint base
    site base
  case flow, mint flow
    site flow
  case task, mint task
    site task
  hook make
    make hook
      bind name, read name
      bind line, read line
      bind base, read base
      bind flow, read flow
      bind task, read task
